                <img alt="GraphQL federated schema showing merged Product type with fields from multiple subgraphs, including basic product fields (id, name, price) and nested reviews, demonstrating schema composition in GraphQL Federation" class="z-20 block h-auto w-full rounded-xl shadow-xl" role="presentation" src={supergraphSchemaImage.src} />
