                  <img alt="A code snippet of a query sent by a client to the GraphQL gateway" class="z-20 block h-auto w-full rounded-xl shadow-xl" role="presentation" src={queryImage.src} title="A code snippet of a query sent by a client to the GraphQL gateway" />
                  <p class="mt-4 text-center text-sm">The gateway resolves the query by sending parts of it to the right subgraphs.</p>
